@startuml UC-A12-register-and-wait-for-approval-registration
!include ../../domain/diagrams/_style.puml
skinparam participantPadding 6
skinparam boxPadding 4
skinparam maxMessageSize 90
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ParticipantFontSize 11
skinparam NoteFontSize 11
hide footbox
title UC-A12 Register at Keycloak (steps 1 to 3, built)
' Registration is Keycloak's. Playground sees nothing until the first request (see the sequence file).

actor "Person" as P
participant "Web routes" as W #E6F0FB
participant "Keycloak" as K #ECECEC

P -> W : 1 create an account
W --> P : 1 redirect, prompt=create
P -> K : 2 name, email, password
K -> K : 2 create the user
K --> P : 2 signed in, back with code
P -> W : 3 callback, session made (UC-A10)
@enduml
